{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20261026060312b02f25590aab40e7","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"STR070 = printed page 67 — photos Sl. 3-5 + **THE LEAD PIPE G**: \n\n- **\"Drenaža bazena A obavljala se preko olovne cevi G prečnika 155 mm, sa otvorom na nivou poda bazena. (сл. 6 и 7). Cev se pružala ispod poda bazena B, po čitavoj njegovoj dužini. Na svom severnom kraju, na izlasku iz temeljnog zida bazena B, ova cev se svakako ulivala u zidani odvodni kanal G, čiji ostaci na žalost nisu mogli biti registrovani.¹³ Na oba kraja olovna cev je u masi zidova bazena B bila zaštićena od eventualnog sleganja objekta na taj način što je provučena kroz prethodno pripremljene rupe u kamenim blokovima, koji su bile sastavni deo zidne mase (сл. 9 и 10).¹⁴\"**\n\n  **OLOVNA CEV G PREČNIK 155 mm** — that's a BIG fistula! This is the drainage pipe of basin A → under basin B → into masonry drainage channel (also called G? probably \"kanal G\" — wait, earlier G was the lead pipe itself: \"olovna cev većeg prečnika (na planu obeležena sa G)\". Here: \"cev se svakako ulivala u zidani odvodni kanal G\" — hmm, so G labels the whole assembly. Anyway: **fistula Ø 155 mm** — key number for hydraulic calc!\n\n  Hmm wait — but is G drainage of basin A (overflow/flushing) or the supply? Text says \"Drenaža bazena A obavljala se preko olovne cevi G\" — drainage (emptying/cleaning outlet) of basin A, with opening at floor level, passing under basin B along its whole length, at northern end pouring into masonry drainage channel. So G = emptying/drain line, Ø 155 mm. That's a classic piscina drain, not the distribution line. The distribution to naselje is kanal E (zidani kanal from bazen B).\n\n  For hydraulic calc: distribution channel E is a covered masonry channel — but the villa end has lead pipes (nimfej, kadijunica). The fistula in villa room 12 (198.49). Diameter of villa fistulae unknown from base; nimfej photo shows lead pipes.\n\n- Photos: Sl. 3 (pogled sa juga), Sl. 4 (bazen B \"bazen za distribuciju vode B\", snimio J. Šurđilović 1970(?)), Sl. 5 (Jugoistočni ugao).\n- Wall surfaces: only north part walls had waterproof plaster (2 cm layer, flat vertical line 10 m south of partition wall between A and B — сл. 7); others dersevane (тисано) krečnim malterom with izvučene linije prema obliku kamena (pulled joints) — noticed also on palate zidine.\n- Footnote 13: kratki vremenski rok od otpočetka arheoloških radova nije dozvolio da se taj deo terena detaljno istraži. Kasnije, prilikom radova na preseljenju objekta(?) propuštena prilika da se istraže eventualni ostaci zidanog odvodnog kanala G.\n- Footnote 14: cev je u dužini otkrivena prilikom radova na preseljenju objekta, kojima autor ovog priloga nije prisustvovao. Fotografije 9 i 10 dobijene su od guošpodina(?) fotografa J. Šurđilovića u arhitekte S. Gušina u Zavodu za zaštitu spomenika kulture u Nišu.\n\nIMPORTANT: \"preseljenje objekta\" — the castellum was MOVED (displaced/relocated) during works?! \"prilikom radova na preseljenju objekta\" — probably \"premeštanju\" — the complex was relocated because of industrial complex construction? That's a preservation event worth noting: the castellum was physically relocated. Actually context: the industrial zone (Elektronska industrija) was built over Vlaško brdo — the kastelum may have been threatened. Note with medium confidence.\n\nNext: str071 — likely BAZEN B section.","signature":"099628f84bf649b4832a9905"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e1438346-843d-4d42-b992-1d35828f0fa4","uuid":"cfe3ef99-877b-41d3-8bb3-b2060df20f3d","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:03:38.986Z"}
