hed small channels E and F side by side (Ø small arches ~25 cm marked) with the Ø95 lead pipe visible (circle).\n\n- The ojačavajuća konstrukcija: **noseći zidovi oba kanala poluvaljkano(?) zidani konstrukcijom izvedenom od oblutaka u krečnom malteru, proteže se duž čitavog severnog zida bazena B, sa kojim čini monolitnu celinu. Neša(?) širina iznosi 2,50 m, a visina 80 cm.** — foundation reinforcement 2.50 m wide, 80 cm high along the whole north wall of B.\n\nGreat detail. Continue: str080 (printed 77).","signature":"239fd09a8480455bb37aa257"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e1438346-843d-4d42-b992-1d35828f0fa4","uuid":"943aa10c-d21b-4b6e-8599-ff39f2206405","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:08:44.767Z"}
